abstract: >-
  A foundational preprint proposing a typed audit calculus for claims that
  move between scientific descriptions. The release contains the paper,
  editable source, a two-page synopsis, audit ledgers, eight exact mathematical
  fixtures, and one deterministic execution receipt.
